---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy in this product preview." description="What this website stores locally and what still needs to be defined before the commerce service launches.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Preview notice \u00b7 15 October 2026" title="Privacy in this product preview." lede="What this website stores locally and what still needs to be defined before the commerce service launches." />
<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 prose-kora">
<h2>Forms and local drafts</h2>
<p>The pilot-interest form stores your name, business type, business name and contact number in session storage in this tab. Reviewing a draft does not submit it. Sending through WhatsApp shares it with the recipient and that service. Contact and demo forms use local storage for drafts and open external communication tools.</p>
<h2>Preferences</h2>
<p>Theme and consent choices are saved in browser storage. No analytics collector is implemented in this source. The hosting service may process request and security information under its own policies.</p>
<h2>Future merchant data</h2>
<p>Live orders, customer records, payments, inventory and optional conversation processing require a published production privacy notice. Operator details, purposes, providers, retention, access requests and contact channels must be confirmed before onboarding live data.</p>
<h2>Current limits</h2>
<p>The preview does not connect to your personal chats, bank account or store. Do not enter payment credentials or sensitive customer records into the demonstration.</p>
<p><a href="/pilot" class="btn btn-primary">Explore the founding pilot</a></p>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
